        <h3>🗣️ 10 Weekly Speaking Topics & Sentence Patterns</h3>
        <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);">Gunakan pola kalimat ini untuk latihan berbicara (speaking practice) di setiap minggunya.</p>
        
        <div class="topic-item">
            <strong>1. Daily System Maintenance</strong><br>
            <em>Pattern:</em> I usually [action] every [timeframe] to ensure [benefit].<br>
            <em>Example:</em> "I usually check the server logs every morning to ensure system stability."
        </div>
        <div class="topic-item">
            <strong>2. Software & Tool Usage</strong><br>
            <em>Pattern:</em> For [task], I use [Tool/Software] because it helps me [benefit].<br>
            <em>Example:</em> "For data analysis, I use Python because it helps me process data quickly."
        </div>
        <div class="topic-item">
            <strong>3. Reporting Bugs & Issues</strong><br>
            <em>Pattern:</em> When [issue] happens, I immediately [action] and notify [person].<br>
            <em>Example:</em> "When a server error happens, I immediately run diagnostics and notify the team lead."
        </div>
        <div class="topic-item">
            <strong>4. Meeting & Stand-up Updates</strong><br>
            <em>Pattern:</em> Today, I am focusing on [task], and my next step is [next task].<br>
            <em>Example:</em> "Today, I am focusing on fixing database bugs, and my next step is code review."
        </div>
        <div class="topic-item">
            <strong>5. Explaining Project Deadlines</strong><br>
            <em>Pattern:</em> The deadline for [project/task] is on [day/date], and we are currently [status].<br>
            <em>Example:</em> "The deadline for the API integration is on Friday, and we are currently testing."
        </div>
        <div class="topic-item">
            <strong>6. Hardware & Equipment Check</strong><br>
            <em>Pattern:</em> We need to inspect [equipment] because [reason].<br>
            <em>Example:</em> "We need to inspect the cooling fans because the temperature is rising."
        </div>
        <div class="topic-item">
            <strong>7. Requesting Assistance or Permission</strong><br>
            <em>Pattern:</em> Could you please help me [action] or grant me access to [resource]?<br>
            <em>Example:</em> "Could you please help me review this pull request or grant me access to the staging server?"
        </div>
        <div class="topic-item">
            <strong>8. Data Presentation & Numbers</strong><br>
            <em>Pattern:</em> The performance metric increased by [X]% compared to [previous period].<br>
            <em>Example:</em> "The server response speed increased by 25% compared to last week."
        </div>
        <div class="topic-item">
            <strong>9. Writing Technical Email Summaries</strong><br>
            <em>Pattern:</em> I am writing to update you on the status of [project/task].<br>
            <em>Example:</em> "I am writing to update you on the status of the migration to AWS."
        </div>
        <div class="topic-item">
            <strong>10. Q&A and Clarification Sessions</strong><br>
            <em>Pattern:</em> Could you clarify what you mean by [technical term or requirement]?<br>
            <em>Example:</em> "Could you clarify what you mean by 'low-latency payload' in the specification?"
        </div>
    </div>

