    <!-- 10 Multiple Choice Questions with Explanations -->
    <div class="card">
        <h3>📝 10 Multiple Choice Assessment & Explanations</h3>
        <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);">Pilih jawaban yang benar. Penjelasan akan muncul jika jawaban Anda salah atau untuk memperkuat pemahaman.</p>

        <!-- Soal 1 -->
        <div class="quiz-item">
            <p><strong>1. The engineer ___ not use Python for this hardware project.</strong></p>
            <div class="quiz-options">
                <label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="A"> A. do</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="B" data-correct="true"> B. does</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="C"> C. doing</label>
            </div>
            <div class="explanation" id="exp1">❌ <strong>Penjelasan:</strong> Subjek "The engineer" adalah bentuk tunggal ketiga (singular third-person / He/She/It), sehingga dalam kalimat negatif bentuk Present Simple menggunakan <strong>doesn't (does not)</strong>, bukan don't.</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Soal 2 -->
        <div class="quiz-item">
            <p><strong>2. ___ your supervisor check the server logs every morning?</strong></p>
            <div class="quiz-options">
                <label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="A"> A. Do</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="B" data-correct="true"> B. Does</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="C"> C. Is</label>
            </div>
            <div class="explanation" id="exp2">❌ <strong>Penjelasan:</strong> Karena "your supervisor" adalah subjek tunggal (orang ketiga), maka kata kerja bantu (auxiliary verb) yang digunakan di awal kalimat tanya Present Simple adalah <strong>Does</strong>.</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Soal 3 -->
        <div class="quiz-item">
            <p><strong>3. We ___ manual repairs; we always use automated diagnostic scripts.</strong></p>
            <div class="quiz-options">
                <label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="A" data-correct="true"> A. don't do</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="B"> B. doesn't do</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="C"> C. not do</label>
            </div>
            <div class="explanation" id="exp3">❌ <strong>Penjelasan:</strong> Subjek "We" menggunakan bentuk plural (jamak), sehingga bentuk negatif untuk kebiasaan (Present Simple) adalah <strong>don't (do not)</strong>.</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Soal 4 -->
        <div class="quiz-item">
            <p><strong>4. Every day, I ___ the system testing and write a daily progress report.</strong></p>
            <div class="quiz-options">
                <label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="A" data-correct="true"> A. do</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="B"> B. does</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="C"> C. doing</label>
            </div>
            <div class="explanation" id="exp4">❌ <strong>Penjelasan:</strong> Subjek "I" menggunakan bentuk dasar verb <strong>do</strong> dalam kalimat positif Present Simple (I do, You do, We do, They do).</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Soal 5 -->
        <div class="quiz-item">
            <p><strong>5. What software ___ you use for data analysis in your daily workflow?</strong></p>
            <div class="quiz-options">
                <label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="A"> A. does</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="B" data-correct="true"> B. do</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="C"> C. is</label>
            </div>
            <div class="explanation" id="exp5">❌ <strong>Penjelasan:</strong> Pertanyaan dengan subjek "you" menggunakan kata kerja bantu <strong>do</strong> (What do you use...?).</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Soal 6 -->
        <div class="quiz-item">
            <p><strong>6. The testing equipment ___ properly when the room temperature gets too high.</strong></p>
            <div class="quiz-options">
                <label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="A"> A. don't work</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="B" data-correct="true"> B. doesn't work</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="C"> C. not working</label>
            </div>
            <div class="explanation" id="exp6">❌ <strong>Penjelasan:</strong> "The testing equipment" dianggap sebagai kata benda tunggal (it), sehingga bentuk negatifnya menggunakan <strong>doesn't work</strong>.</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Soal 7 -->
        <div class="quiz-item">
            <p><strong>7. My colleagues and I ___ code reviews every Tuesday afternoon.</strong></p>
            <div class="quiz-options">
                <label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="A" data-correct="true"> A. conduct</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="B"> B. conducts</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="C"> C. conducting</label>
            </div>
            <div class="explanation" id="exp7">❌ <strong>Penjelasan:</strong> "My colleagues and I" adalah subjek jamak (plural), sehingga menggunakan verb bentuk dasar tanpa penambahan -s/-es, yaitu <strong>conduct</strong>.</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Soal 8 -->
        <div class="quiz-item">
            <p><strong>8. ___ your team maintain server stability throughout the week?</strong></p>
            <div class="quiz-options">
                <label><input type="radio" name="q8" value="A"> A. Are</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="q8" value="B"> B. Does</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="q8" value="C" data-correct="true"> C. Do</label>
            </div>
            <div class="explanation" id="exp8">❌ <strong>Penjelasan:</strong> Kata "team" dalam konteks operasional kelompok secara kolektif sering menggunakan auxiliary <strong>Do</strong> (atau Does dalam bentuk tunggal mutlak, namun bentuk standar interogatif kelompok kerja menggunakan Do).</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Soal 9 -->
        <div class="quiz-item">
            <p><strong>9. She ___ touch the hardware directly because her main focus is software development.</strong></p>
            <div class="quiz-options">
                <label><input type="radio" name="q9" value="A"> A. don't</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="q9" value="B" data-correct="true"> B. doesn't</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="q9" value="C"> C. isn't</label>
            </div>
            <div class="explanation" id="exp9">❌ <strong>Penjelasan:</strong> Subjek "She" adalah kata ganti orang ketiga tunggal, sehingga kata kerja bantu negatifnya adalah <strong>doesn't</strong>.</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Soal 10 -->
        <div class="quiz-item">
            <p><strong>10. How often ___ you update the API documentation?</strong></p>
            <div class="quiz-options">
                <label><input type="radio" name="q10" value="A" data-correct="true"> A. do</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="q10" value="B"> B. does</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="q10" value="C"> C. are</label>
            </div>
            <div class="explanation" id="exp10">❌ <strong>Penjelasan:</strong> Pertanyaan dengan kata tanya "How often" untuk subjek "you" memerlukan auxiliary verb <strong>do</strong> di depannya.</div>
        </div>

